  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "For people like me who enjoys sharing/spreading the love to friends and making them smile, I think it would be a good idea to be able to mail players even when they're offline atleast twice a day and send them a brief message and/or interactive objects like food or a drink so when they log on they'll be able to see it ☺️\n\nI feel like instant messaging system would be good too but I think it would kill the thrill of meeting people and vrchat would get dull rather quickly imo, since pens are already available. Maybe add pens on the menu instead? I feel like mailing would be much better and would spice things up a little tbh, gives you something to look forward to when logging on. Just a thought.",
